000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','a1000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9',NULL,'You can use actions/cache or setup-dotnet built-in caching depending on your workflow.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-28 10:30:00','2026-03-28 10:30:00',NULL),('d4000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','a1000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','bbcb5404-27d8-463f-baac-6f1a3539b344',NULL,'Check whether your cache key includes the correct OS and lock file hash.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-28 10:35:00','2026-03-28 10:35:00',NULL),('d4000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003','a1000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111','d4000001-0000-0000-0000-000000000001','Thanks, I will try using cache based on packages.lock.json first.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-28 10:40:00','2026-03-28 10:40:00',NULL),('d4000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','a1000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111',NULL,'Make sure the Docker build context matches the workspace directory Jenkins is using.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-29 11:30:00','2026-03-29 11:30:00',NULL),('d4000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005','a1000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9',NULL,'Also verify whether the agent running Jenkins actually has access to the Docker daemon.','https://res.cloudinary.com/dhcbhatn9/image/upload/v1777197903/devops-aihub/avatars/Screenshot_2026-03-14_112004_vmfyfn.png','devops-aihub/avatars/Screenshot_2026-03-14_112004_vmfyfn','Active','2026-03-29 11:35:00','2026-04-26 10:05:06',NULL),('d4000006-0000-0000-0000-000000000006','a1000002-0000-0000-0000-000000000002','22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222','d4000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','Good point. I will print the workspace and Dockerfile path in the next run.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-29 11:40:00','2026-03-29 11:40:00',NULL),('d4000007-0000-0000-0000-000000000007','a1000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003','22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222',NULL,'If you use Prometheus Operator, ServiceMonitor is usually cleaner than manual annotations.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-30 12:30:00','2026-03-30 12:30:00',NULL),('d4000008-0000-0000-0000-000000000008','a1000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003','bbcb5404-27d8-463f-baac-6f1a3539b344',NULL,'Expose /metrics on a dedicated port if your application already serves public traffic elsewhere.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-30 12:35:00','2026-03-30 12:35:00',NULL),('d4000009-0000-0000-0000-000000000009','a1000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003','33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333','d4000008-0000-0000-0000-000000000008','Understood. I am using Prometheus Operator, so I will try the ServiceMonitor approach.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-30 12:40:00','2026-03-30 12:40:00',NULL),('d4000010-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','a1000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333',NULL,'A common cause is server-side default values being re-ordered or normalized by Kubernetes after apply.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-31 13:30:00','2026-03-31 13:30:00',NULL),('d4000011-0000-0000-0000-000000000011','a1000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9',NULL,'[Deleted comment]',NULL,NULL,'Deleted','2026-03-31 13:35:00','2026-04-22 10:34:01','2026-04-22 10:34:01'),('d4000012-0000-0000-0000-000000000012','a1000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444','d4000010-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','That makes sense. I will inspect diff output and ignore fields that are not stable.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-03-31 13:40:00','2026-03-31 13:40:00',NULL),('d4000013-0000-0000-0000-000000000013','a1000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005','44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444',NULL,'Looks good for a first version. You may want to split cache and build image steps more clearly.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-04-01 14:30:00','2026-04-01 14:30:00',NULL),('d4000014-0000-0000-0000-000000000014','a1000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005','11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111',NULL,'Consider adding security scanning before pushing the image to the registry.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-04-01 14:35:00','2026-04-01 14:35:00',NULL),('d4000015-0000-0000-0000-000000000015','a1000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000005','55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555','d4000013-0000-0000-0000-000000000013','Thanks, I plan to add a separate scan stage and maybe deploy only on protected branches.',NULL,NULL,'Active','2026-04-01 14:40:00','2026-04-01 14:40:00',NULL),('f1eb0f7a-8dfb-43fb-a41b-8923ce07c478','a1000004-0000-0000-0000-000000000004','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9','d4000010-0000-0000-0000-000000000010','[Deleted comment]',NULL,NULL,'Deleted','2026-04-22 09:32:20','2026-04-22 09:34:24','2026-04-22 09:34:24'),('f99849ac-68c7-4817-b0bb-596151da115a','a1000003-0000-0000-0000-000000000003','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9','d4000009-0000-0000-0000-000000000009','[Deleted comment]',NULL,NULL,'Deleted','2026-04-26 06:37:22','2026-04-26 06:37:46','2026-04-26 06:37:46'),('facd754f-b604-45c4-9c9a-496e99cc82c7','a89145e1-f773-4bbc-9aee-cc5fa861112b','6d49c8d7-9dce-4274-9f75-b0f2f911a1b9',NULL,'[Deleted comment]',NULL,NULL,'Deleted','2026-04-26 07:34:41','2026-04-26 07:35:09','2026-04-26 07:35:09');
